docs/reports/
# NOTE: docs/verification/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It was, and that is how the verification status ended up in a state where
# three agents had written three contradictory "current status" documents that
# no one else could see, because new files written there were silently dropped
# from version control. 636 of its files were already tracked, so ignoring the
# directory was incoherent anyway. The canonical, generated artifacts that must
# be reviewable in a diff live here:
#   STATUS.md              generated work queue and totals
#   AGENT-PLAYBOOK.md      the workflow every agent must follow
#   integrity-baseline.json  the known-debt ratchet
modules/backups/
tools/tmp_*
